[0.052, "o", "╔════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗\r\n║           SUMO-NIX CAPABILITY DISCOVERY                         ║\r\n║       \"What novel capabilities can I compose?\"                  ║\r\n╚═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝\r\n\r\n📦 DIRECT COMPOSITIONS (6) — package + immediate deps:\r\n  🔗 automake composes BuildAutomation + BuildConfiguration\r\n  🔗 git composes VersionControl + HTTPClient\r\n  🔗 libarchive composes ArchiveHandling + Compression\r\n  🔗 nginx composes HTTPServer + TLS\r\n  🔗 nginx composes LoadBalancer + TLS\r\n  🔗 nginx composes ReverseProxy + TLS\r\n\r\n🌐 ENABLED CAPABILITIES (10) — via transitive dependency closure:\r\n  ✨ automake enables BuildConfiguration via dependency closure\r\n  ✨ git enables HTTPClient via dependency closure\r\n  ✨ git enables SFTP via dependency closure\r\n  ✨ git enables SSHClient via dependency closure\r\n  ✨ libarchive enables Compression via dependency closure\r\n  ✨ libgcrypt enables Crypto via dependency closure\r\n  ✨ nginx enables Crypto via dependency closure\r\n  ✨ nginx enables TLS via dependency closure\r\n  ✨ nginx enables X509 via dependency closure\r\n  ✨ postgresql enables SQL via dependency closure\r\n\r\n💡 SYNERGIES (2) — 3+ capabilities combining:\r\n  🚀 git synergy: HTTPClient + SFTP + SSHClient\r\n  🚀 nginx synergy: Crypto + TLS + X509\r\n\r\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n✨ Your nixpkgs is a capability goldmine.\r\n"]
